        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kanen kapaaran nakiwuniet, koany, kobu etuŋanan koidukurun kama ejai Saul kocilicilite ikenapen, kojukite alupot da akouke; kosodi kedol mama ejai Daudi, kisuded, kiyoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Daudi ŋes ebe, “Laali bo kibunio?” Kotema atiar, “Akui koidukurun luka Isirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala Daudi ŋes ebe, “Ekote bo ai? Keŋaiŋait kolimokinai.” Koboŋok ebe, “Akera ituŋa kojie, ido ebiroros ituŋa luipu atwaka; Saul ka okokuke Yonatan atwaka kesi da.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Daudi etelepat lokelimokini ŋes ebe, “Kijenuni biai ebe atwana Saul ka okokuke Yonatan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.10.1+1CH.10.2+1CH.10.3+1CH.10.4+1CH.10.5+1CH.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Siit 10:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema etelepat lokelimokini ŋes atiar, “Napajaar eoŋ moru Giliboa, koany, kogoŋakin Saul akwarake; ido koany, agalin ka luibwanenito kituburuunitos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi keŋolia kau, kaany eoŋ, kanyara. Kaboŋok ebe, “Eoŋ lo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katemaeoŋ atiar, ‘Iŋai bo ijo?’ Kaboŋok ŋes ebe, “Eoŋ Emalekait.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katema eoŋ atiar, ‘Keŋaiŋait, kobwo kosiepika, koar eoŋ, naarai kerumut iean; naarai akaijar eroko ejari kotomakaŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.9.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tub 9:54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kasodi aibwo kosiepike, kaar ŋes, naarai abu kajen cut ebe mam epedori araut ekajaran kedau aibirokin kwap; kayaŋa aboko naajai akouke, ka aisinit naajai akanike, ido ayaunit mama ejai ekajakait.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
