              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kitiŋ Daudi ikenapen kocil; kiswamata da kwape kwaŋin ituŋa kere lukejaas kaŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibworoto, komonyata akiyo, koluŋata aitiwar akwap, kanuka Saul, kanuka Yonatan da okokuke, kanuka ituŋa luka EJAKAIT, kanuka ekek da loka Isirael; naarai ebiroros kekileŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Daudi etelepat lokelimokini ŋes ebe, “Lokai bo ijo?” Koboŋok ebe, “Arai eoŋ okoku loka emoit, Emalekait.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
