            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala Daudi ŋes ebe, “Kanukinyo mam kiyoŋia arior akonikan amudiar ŋol loinyonyoikinit EJAKAIT akinyet?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
